---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import portrait from '../assets/portrait.jpeg';
---

<Base title="About" description="Who writes here.">
	<div class="page about-grid">
		<Image
			class="portrait"
			src={portrait}
			width={200}
			height={240}
			densities={[1, 2, 3]}
			fit="cover"
			alt="Chima, sitting on a fallen tree in woodland."
			loading="eager"
		/>
		<div>
			<h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
			<p>
				Principal Software Architect, eighteen years and counting in IT. Long enough to have watched
				a few settled questions get reopened, and a few of my own confident answers quietly retired.
			</p>
			<p>
				This site is where the notes go. Some of it is written to share &mdash; a problem worth
				describing, a decision worth the reasoning behind it. Most of it is written for me in six
				months, when I need to know what I chose and cannot remember why. Publishing it is the
				cheapest way to keep it somewhere I will actually look.
			</p>
			<p>
				Husband, father of two. I play soulslike games and most things shaped like them, which is
				probably the same instinct that makes the day job enjoyable &mdash; a problem that does not
				care how you feel about it, and gives way only once you have actually understood it. What is
				left of my attention goes to the NFL.
			</p>
			<dl class="facts">
				<dt>Work</dt>
				<dd>Principal Software Architect</dd>
				<dt>Years in</dt>
				<dd>18 and counting</dd>
				<dt>Based</dt>
				<dd>Croatia, CET</dd>
				<dt>Site</dt>
				<dd>Astro, no tracking, no cookie banner</dd>
			</dl>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="page page-body"></div>
</Base>
